{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"curl -L --silent --show-error 'https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=directly%20develops%20from&ontology=ro' | head -c 6000\"","aggregated_output":"{\"response\":{\"docs\":[{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002207\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002207\",\"description\":[\"Candidate definition: x directly_develops from y if and only if there exists some developmental process (GO:0032502) p such that x and y both participate in p, and x is the output of p and y is the input of p, and a substantial portion of the matter of x comes from y, and the start of x is coincident with or after the end of y.\",\"TODO - add child relations from DOS\"],\"label\":\"directly develops from\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002207\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"has developmental precursor\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002210\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002210\",\"description\":[\"inverse of directly develops from\"],\"label\":\"directly develops into\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002210\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002202\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002202\",\"description\":[\"This is the transitive form of the develops from relation\",\"x develops from y if and only if either (a) x directly develops from y or (b) there exists some z such that x directly develops from z and z develops from y\"],\"label\":\"develops from\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002202\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002225\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002225\",\"description\":[\"x develops from part of y if and only if there exists some z such that x develops from z and z is part of y\"],\"label\":\"develops from part of\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002225\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002203\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002203\",\"description\":[\"inverse of develops from\"],\"label\":\"develops into\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002203\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002226\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002226\",\"description\":[\"x develops_in y if x is located in y whilst x is developing\"],\"label\":\"develops in\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002226\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002578\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002578\",\"description\":[\"p directly regulates q iff p is immediately causally upstream of q and p regulates q.\"],\"label\":\"directly regulates\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002578\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002022\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002022\",\"description\":[\"Process(P2) is directly regulated by process(P1) iff: P1 regulates P2 via direct physical interaction between an agent executing P1 (or some part of P1) and an agent executing P2 (or some part of P2).  For example, if protein A has protein binding activity(P1) that targets protein B and this binding  regulates the kinase activity (P2) of protein B then P1 directly regulates P2.\"],\"label\":\"directly regulated by\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002022\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002629\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002629\",\"description\":[\"p directly positively regulates q iff p is immediately causally upstream of q, and p positively regulates q.\"],\"label\":\"directly positively regulates\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002629\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002630\",\"ontology_name\":\"ro\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"RO\",\"short_form\":\"RO_0002630\",\"description\":[\"p directly negatively regulates q iff p is immediately causally upstream of q, and p negatively regulates q.\"],\"label\":\"directly negatively regulates\",\"obo_id\":\"RO:0002630\",\"type\":\"objectProperty\"}],\"numFound\":190,\"start\":0},\"responseHeader\":{\"QTime\":84,\"status\":0},\"facet_counts\":{\"facet_fields\":{\"ontologyPreferredPrefix\":[\"RO\",\"190\",\"ADDICTO\",\"0\",\"ADO\",\"0\",\"AEO\",\"0\",\"AFO\",\"0\",\"AGRO\",\"0\",\"AISM\",\"0\",\"AMPHX\",\"0\",\"APO\",\"0\",\"APOLLO_SV\",\"0\",\"ARO\",\"0\",\"AfPO\",\"0\",\"BAO\",\"0\",\"BCIO\",\"0\",\"BCO\",\"0\",\"BFO\",\"0\",\"BMONT\",\"0\",\"BSPO\",\"0\",\"BTO\",\"0\",\"CAO\",\"0\",\"CARO\",\"0\",\"CCF\",\"0\",\"CCO\",\"0\",\"CDAO\",\"0\",\"CDNO\",\"0\",\"CHEBI\",\"0\",\"CHEMINF\",\"0\",\"CHIRO\",\"0\",\"CHMO\",\"0\",\"CIDO\",\"0\",\"CIO\",\"0\",\"CL\",\"0\",\"CLAO\",\"0\",\"CLO\",\"0\",\"CLYH\",\"0\",\"CMO\",\"0\",\"CMPO\",\"0\",\"COB\",\"0\",\"COLAO\",\"0\",\"COVOC\",\"0\",\"CPONT\",\"0\",\"CRO\",\"0\",\"CTENO\",\"0\",\"CVDO\",\"0\",\"DDANAT\",\"0\",\"DDPHENO\",\"0\",\"DHBA\",\"0\",\"DIDEO\",\"0\",\"DISDRIV\",\"0\",\"DMBA\",\"0\",\"DOID\",\"0\",\"DRON\",\"0\",\"DUO\",\"0\",\"EC\",\"0\",\"ECAO\",\"0\",\"ECO\",\"0\",\"ECOCORE\",\"0\",\"ECTO\",\"0\",\"EDAM\",\"0\",\"EFO\",\"0\",\"EMAPA\",\"0\",\"EMI\",\"0\",\"ENM\",\"0\",\"ENSGLOSS\",\"0\",\"ENVO\",\"0\",\"EPIO\",\"0\",\"EUPATH\",\"0\",\"EXMO\",\"0\",\"ExO\",\"0\",\"FAO\",\"0\",\"FBbi\",\"0\",\"FBbt\",\"0\",\"FBcv\",\"0\",\"FBdv\",\"0\",\"FIDEO\",\"0\",\"FLOPO\",\"0\",\"FMA\",\"0\",\"FOBI\",\"0\",\"FOODON\",\"0\",\"FOVT\",\"0\",\"FYPO\",\"0\",\"GALLONT\",\"0\",\"GAZ\",\"0\",\"GECKO\",\"0\",\"GENEPIO\",\"0\",\"GENO\",\"0\",\"GEO\",\"0\",\"GNO\",\"0\",\"GO\",\"0\",\"GSSO\",\"0\",\"GeXO\",\"0\",\"HANCESTRO\",\"0\",\"HAO\",\"0\",\"HBA\",\"0\",\"HCAO\",\"0\",\"HOM\",\"0\",\"HP\",\"0\",\"HSO\",\"0\",\"HTN\",\"0\",\"HsapDv\",\"0\"],\"isDefiningOntology\